  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Serenity by the Sea is a newly renovated retreat located in peaceful Pinewood Preserve in Inlet Beach. Only a half-mile from Walton County's largest public beach access & a community pool just steps away from the front door, serenity in the sun & sugar white sand are calling your name. This home offers three bedrooms, two and a half baths and can accommodate up to eight comfortably. With both bright & cheerful decor, this home's open-floor concept was specifically designed with only R & R in mind!<br><br>Upstairs you’ll find a beautiful master suite with a king-sized bed, flat-screen TV, and gorgeous en suite bath with large walk-in shower. The first guest bedroom features a queen-sized bed, while the second offers two twin beds, both complete with flat-screen TVs. A queen sleeper sofa in the living room provides additional sleeping arrangements.<br><br>Nestled in the heart of Inlet Beach, there are a plethora of places to go & things to see…stunning views, amazing food, upscale boutiques, live music, movies under the stars & even a farmer’s market every Saturday in Rosemary Beach. If you are looking for a day away from the sun & sand, you're just a short ride away from Camp Helen State Park, as well as a charming mix of eateries & unique boutique shops at the newly built 30Avenue. Endless options of entertainment await!<br><br>Parties, events, pets, & smoking of any kind are strictly prohibited. If found in violation, guests are subject to immediate eviction without refund.<br><br>Off-Season Monthly Rentals Welcome!<br><br>ACCOMODATIONS/FLOOR:<br>1st FLOOR<br>-Queen Sofa Sleeper in Living Room<br><br>2nd FLOOR<br>-Master Suite w/ King Bed, Stunning Master Bath w/ Walk-In Shower, & Flat Screen TV<br>-Guest Bedroom w/ Queen Bed, Closet, & Flat Screen TV<br>-Guest Bedroom w/ 2 Twin Beds, Walk-In Closet, & Flat Screen TV<br>-Full Bath with Shower/Tub Combo Shared Between Both Guest Bedroom<br><br>HIGHLIGHTS: <br>-1/2 Mile from the Sugar White Sand<br>-Nestled in the heart of Inlet Beach<br>-No Smoking of Any Kind/Pets Permitted<br>-Minimum Age Requirement to Rent is 25<br>-Must be 1 Adult to Accompany Each 4 Guests Under the Age of 25<br>-No Parties/Events Allowed<br><br>AMENITIES:<br>-Small Office Space<br>-Community Pool<br>-Outdoor Shower<br>-Gas Grill<br>-Wi-Fi<br><br>DINING/DRINKS/TREATS/SHOPPING NEARBY:<br>-Shades Bar & Grill<br>-Donut Hole<br>-Shaka Sushi & Cocktail Bar<br>-Cafe' Aroma<br>-Amici Italian Kitchen<br>-Amigos 30A Mexican Kitchen<br>-Cuvee 30A<br>-Goatfeathers at 30Avenue<br>-Southern Charm Coffee & Gather<br>-Olive 30A Oil Co.<br>-Love 2 Run<br>-Not Too Shabby Boutique",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Newly Renovated Inlet Beach Retreat | Community Pool"
        }
      ],
